    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018WDF\u2019, Is a horizontal shmup game with a <strong>Boss-rush</strong> style in that the difficulty will increase slightly after the player clears all stages and continues to the next loop. Each loop will be different from the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.poster.avif?t=1750148611\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.webm?t=1750148611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.mp4?t=1750148611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Moon has awakened\u2014and it is hungry.</strong> No longer a cold rock in space, it radiates an unnatural fire, turning night into an extinction event. The world is burning. <strong>Humanity\u2019s last hope: an elite strike team sent to the Moon to uncover the cause and put an end to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of players ship with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of enemy types including bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online leaderboard</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018WDF\u2019, Is a horizontal shmup game with a <strong>Boss-rush</strong> style in that the difficulty will increase slightly after the player clears all stages and continues to the next loop. Each loop will be different from the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.poster.avif?t=1750148611\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.webm?t=1750148611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.mp4?t=1750148611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Moon has awakened\u2014and it is hungry.</strong> No longer a cold rock in space, it radiates an unnatural fire, turning night into an extinction event. The world is burning. <strong>Humanity\u2019s last hope: an elite strike team sent to the Moon to uncover the cause and put an end to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of players ship with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of enemy types including bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online leaderboard</p></li></ul>",
